IsResetting [SimTalk]
Returns if the EventController designated by <Path> is being reset at the moment (true) or not (false).
Remarks
Plant Simulation sets IsResetting to true when you reset the simulation model with the EventController
designated by <Path>.
Plant Simulation sets it to false again as soon as all reset methods have been processed.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.IsResetting → boolean
Watchable
The read-only attribute is watchable.
Return Value
The return value has the data type boolean.
Example
print EventController.IsResetting
See also
reset [SimTalk] - EventController
IsResetting [SimTalk]
